         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">How all or part of a network can be secured transparently to peer protocol entities that use the MAC Service provided by IEEE 802Â® LANs to communicate is specified in this standard. MAC security (MACsec) provides connectionless user data confidentiality, frame data integrity, and data origin authenticity.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
